{"id": "14-2781-2-5", "zh": "Gacchamāno、gacchanto（正在走的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2781-6-9", "zh": "Gacchati、gameti（他走）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2781-10-13", "zh": "Gacchatu、gametu（让他走）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2781-14-15", "zh": "Gaccheyya（他应当走）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2781-16-17", "zh": "Gameyya（他应当走）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2781-18-21", "zh": "Agacchā、agamā（他曾走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2781-22-25", "zh": "Agacchī、agamī（他走了）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2781-26-29", "zh": "Gacchissati、gamissati（他将走）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2781-30-33", "zh": "Agacchissā、agamissā（他本会走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2782-2-6", "zh": "为什么说“**gamisse**（gamu 的）”？", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-2782-7-8", "zh": "反例：icchati（想要）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-2783-2-10", "zh": "477、479. vaca 的 a 在 ajjatanī（不定过去时）中变为 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2784-2-11", "zh": "vaca 这个词根的 a 音，在 ajjatanī 语尾时变成 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2785-2-3", "zh": "Avoca（他说了）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2785-4-5", "zh": "Avocuṃ（他们说了）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2786-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**在 ajjatanī 时**”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2786-6-9", "zh": "反例：avaca、avacū。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-2787-2-12", "zh": "478、438. a 音在 hi、mi、ma 之前变长。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2788-2-8", "zh": "a 音在 hi、mi、ma 这些语尾之前变成长音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2789-2-9", "zh": "Gacchāhi（你走吧）、gacchāmi（我走）、gacchāma（我们走）、gacchāmhe（我们走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2790-2-9", "zh": "由于取了 mi 字，在 hi 语尾之前 a 音有时不变长。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2790-10-11", "zh": "Gacchahi（你走吧）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2791-2-10", "zh": "479、452. hi 可选地脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2792-2-6", "zh": "hi 语尾可选地脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2793-2-13", "zh": "Gaccha、gacchāhi、gama、gamāhi、gamaya、gamayāhi（你走吧）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2794-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**hi**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2794-6-9", "zh": "反例：gacchati、gamayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2795-2-10", "zh": "480、490. hū 的元音在 bhavissantī（未来时）中变为 eha、oha、e，ssa 也会脱落。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-2796-2-21", "zh": "hū 这个词根的元音，在 bhavissantī 语尾时变成 eha、oha、e，而 ssa 可选地脱落。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-2797-2-25", "zh": "Hehiti、hehinti、hohiti、hohinti、heti、henti、hehissati、hehissanti、hohissati、hohissanti、hessati、hessanti（他／他们将会是）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2798-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**hū**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2798-6-9", "zh": "反例：bhavissati、bhavissanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2799-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**在 bhavissantī 时**”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2799-6-7", "zh": "反例：hoti（他是）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2800-2-10", "zh": "481、524. kara 连同其词缀变为 kāha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2801-2-19", "zh": "kara 这个词根连同其词缀，在 bhavissantī 语尾时可选地替换为 kāha，而 ssa 则一律脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2802-2-13", "zh": "Kāhati、kāhiti、kāhasi、kāhisi、kāhāmi、kāhāma（将会做）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2803-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**可选地**”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2803-6-9", "zh": "反例：karissati、karissanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2804-2-13", "zh": "由于取了“连同词缀”一语，其他词根在 bhavissantī 语尾时也有 khāmi、khāma、chāmi、chāma 等替换形。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-2804-14-21", "zh": "Vakkhāmi、vakkhāma、vacchāmi、vacchāma（我／我们将说）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2805-2-6", "zh": "以上是动词篇的第三节。", "confidence": 80}
